.DS_Store
node_modules/
.qa-*
.qa/
public/data/sf/*.json
!public/data/sf/sf-footprint-supplement.json
public/data/sf/*.json.gz
# ...except the compact city asset the game boots from. It is 5 MB, and the
# native build (eo-data DataPaths) finds the repo root by it and will not boot
# without it -- so a clone needs it tracked. Its source URLs, licences,
# attribution and SHA-256 digests are in meta.sources.
!public/data/sf/sf-city.json.gz
# ...and the real car parks / green areas layer (ODbL, 0.45 MB; attribution in
# sf-lots-parks.NOTICE.txt beside it). Without it a clone draws no lots and no
# greens.
!public/data/sf/sf-lots-parks.json.gz
# ...and the citywide footprint pack (DataSF Building Footprints, PDDL-1.0,
# 9.6 MB; provenance in sf-footprints.NOTICE.txt beside it).
!public/data/sf/sf-footprints.json.gz
# ...and the city's street storm drains (DataSF jtgq-b7c5, PDDL, 0.16 MB; see
# sf-storm-drains.NOTICE.txt).
!public/data/sf/sf-storm-drains.json.gz
# ...and the citywide map cartography (ODbL + PDDL, 3.5 MB; provenance in
# sf-map-citywide.NOTICE.txt beside it). The pause map and the HUD radar read it.
!public/data/sf/sf-map-citywide.json.gz
public/data/sf/*.geojson
public/data/sf/*.pbf

# Authoritative source rasters and bulk exports are local build inputs, never
# public runtime assets.
Data/raw/usgs-3dep/
Data/raw/noaa-cudem/
Data/raw/datasf/
Data/raw/osm/

# Local QA / session artifacts
tmp/
sessions/

# Claude Code local notes, reviewer term lists, machine-specific paths
.claude/

# Local-only benchmark/reviewer material must never be committed
*.local.md
benchmark-local/

# Local-only visual references, analyses, and quarantined IP-risk media.
.img2threejs/
Docs/visual-targets/
artifacts/img2threejs/
assets/vehicles/img2threejs/
public/assets/hero/sfmoma-img2threejs-*/
public/data/reference-*.jpg

# Agent, editor, and CI tooling is machine-local working material, not part of
# the game. Each contributor brings their own; none of it is needed to build,
# run, or verify the game. The one exception is .github/workflows/: the
# workflow that builds and publishes the playable downloads (Docs/PLAYING.md).
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.cursor/
.github/*
!.github/workflows/

# Internal planning ledgers, kept locally as campaign history.
goals/
plan.md

# Local-only reference-derived working material (never committed).
.img2threejs-evidence/
.tripo/
Docs/art-reference/

# Pipeline source binaries live off-repo in a content-addressed store; only
# artifacts/ASSETS.lock.json is committed. Run `npm run assets:pull` to fetch.
# See Docs/ASSET-STORE.md.
artifacts/tripo/**/*.glb
artifacts/tripo/**/*.fbx
artifacts/tripo/**/*.png
artifacts/tripo/**/*.jpg
artifacts/tripo/**/*.jpeg
artifacts/vehicles/**/*.glb
artifacts/vehicles/**/*.blend
artifacts/vehicles/**/*.png
artifacts/vehicles/**/*.jpg
artifacts/vehicles/**/*.jpeg

# Regenerable local junk: Blender autosave backups and bytecode caches.
*.blend1
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# Tripo-generated street props and the two generated vehicles of unconfirmed
